{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】受高空反氣旋影響，華南天色大致良好。同時，影響廣東沿岸的偏東氣流正逐漸緩和。本港地區今日(10月19日)天氣預測天晴。日間乾燥及炎熱，市區最高氣溫約32度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><p>展望未來數日大致天晴及乾燥。星期三日間酷熱。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T23:38:41.707978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T23:03:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T10:57:23.422725+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T23:37:34.997587+00:00","content_hash":"9dddcee984f031cce7fd0e3996822f1b51208c59927d514e9c703a3117665d39","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}